          "text": "Toenail symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Toenails thick, yellow and crumbly for about 18 months, mainly the great toes; mild discomfort in shoes and cosmetic bother. No pain, discharge or spreading erythema."
      }
    },
